{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Plain.</b> Level ground, as its Targum renders." "<b>From the east.</b> He journeyed from beside Abram and went to Abram's west — so he traveled from east to west. And its midrash — aggadah: he distanced himself from the First One of the world. He said: I want neither Abram nor his Elohim."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:31.805722826Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}